ey must read, understand, and use a construction site layout plan (PIC).\n\nUsing the PIC, they organize the different areas of the site, set up the site compound, manage waste sorting, and take into account the technical and regulatory constraints specific to the construction industry.", "short_description": "The application places learners in a virtual construction site where they must read, understand, and use a construction site layout plan (PIC).\n\nUsing the PIC, they organize the different areas of the site, set up the site compound, manage waste sorting, and take into account the technical and regulatory constraints specific to the construction industry."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Paysage.png", "id": "28866067393088092", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596061819_28866067399754758_5878919847037921873_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WtPZjRIv9oQQ7kNvwEwCIdR&_nc_oc=AdogfBe9MZY9KSMVry2ezgHuSeuZ4UHnhZNNRK9VtUBEQlra1hSL7KdS262B6yFiSas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnJZheJrQOFgQa3PE_ynv9WfYFtk6gOTVRb8qKssm33Q&oe=6AF359CD"}, {"file_name": "couverture.png", "id": "2282742499172780", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596068480_2282742505839446_4516678377198155006_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c8r98OwOMf0Q7kNvwHKv0ED&_nc_oc=AdrUc19sqh1TwgcMNsDKwM8WoMUHa8Blj_yGstSmHAvosni9O5CYhkDj2WlpvIngSmk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRR_aPHA3PDJ83SjfNbNOuF0fxJcDQitg-rwgk48lE_uA&oe=6AF32F66"}, {"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "2230375674542407", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_ICON_512", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673536876_2230375677875740_1471799390897462504_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dJR4DuJRkVAQ7kNvwHecFwS&_nc_oc=AdpLov3o98wj6FbDJRc9crVcimDoL5-0foE2Bein0ne-7fX1ThSB7M